{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S04、S09、S13—S14 压缩了部分心理转折，人物为什么从期待走向害怕、又为什么不愿收回心意，不如 X 交代得完整，部分感受词也有堆叠和过度修饰的问题。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的重点词突出，感受文字号较小且按音乐进程出现，观众更容易在听音乐时抓住当前重点，不必一次消化所有信息；它对旋律、和声、节奏、音色和身体感受的描写也比 X 具体，有更多细腻的听觉层次。X 的优势在人物心理的因果解释和前后叙事衔接，尤其后半段对喜欢、害怕失去、想收回又舍不得的反复挣扎交代得更清楚。综合来看，Y 的即时观看体验和音乐感受更好，但 X 的故事理解更扎实。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5c7e767c-5fa9-489b-8b69-1040180dafca", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T224609101813Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.765, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:47:02.881598+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2d44e13206141a2c6a6c62b4b04c4e214f9abd00166b57c0af8050cb155f519d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42223